{"id": 20370, "title": "Age", "level": "Intermediate", "hsk_tags": ["HSK3"], "slug": "age-story", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/20370_age-story.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["商店的服务员阿姨觉得妈妈看起来很年轻， 爸爸也很高兴。 他们开始猜阿姨多大年纪。 阿姨说， \" 你们猜猜我多少岁？ \" 妈妈想了想， 说： \" 我觉得你四十岁左右。 \" 阿姨笑了， 说： \" 不对， 我今年五十岁了。 \" 大家都感到惊讶。 然后， 他们又聊起了属相， 哪年出生的问题也变得有趣起来。"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["商店的服務員阿姨覺得媽媽看起來很年輕， 爸爸也很高興。 他們開始猜阿姨多大年紀。 阿姨說， \" 你們猜猜我多少歲？ \" 媽媽想了想， 說： \" 我覺得你四十歲左右。 \" 阿姨笑了， 說： \" 不對， 我今年五十歲了。 \" 大家都感到驚訝。 然後， 他們又聊起了屬相， 哪年出生的問題也變得有趣起來。"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["shāng diàn de fú wù yuán ā yí jué de mā ma kàn qǐ lái hěn nián qīng，  bà ba yě hěn gāo xìng。  tā men kāi shǐ cāi ā yí duō dà nián jì。  ā yí shuō， \"  nǐ men cāi cāi wǒ duō shao suì？ \"  mā ma xiǎng le xiǎng，  shuō： \"  wǒ jué de nǐ sì shí suì zuǒ yòu。 \"  ā yí xiào le，  shuō： \"  bù duì，  wǒ jīn nián wǔ shí suì le。 \"  dà jiā dōu gǎn dào jīng yà。  rán hòu，  tā men yòu liáo qǐ le shǔ xiàng，  nǎ nián chū shēng de wèn tí yě biàn de yǒu qù qǐ lái。"], "english_paragraphs": ["The store attendant thought my mother looked very young, and my father was also very happy. They started guessing how old their aunt was. The aunt said, \"Guess how old I am?\" Mom thought for a while and said, \"I think you are about forty years old.\" The aunt smiled and said, \"No, I am fifty years old this year.\" Everyone was surprised. Then, they talked about their zodiac sign, and the question of the year they were born also became interesting."], "english_full": "The store attendant thought my mother looked very young, and my father was also very happy. They started guessing how old their aunt was. The aunt said, \"Guess how old I am?\" Mom thought for a while and said, \"I think you are about forty years old.\" The aunt smiled and said, \"No, I am fifty years old this year.\" Everyone was surprised. Then, they talked about their zodiac sign, and the question of the year they were born also became interesting.", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip